{"book":"2chronicles","num":22,"verses":[{"en":"And the inhabitants of Jerusalem made Ahaziah his youngest son king in his stead: for the band of men that came with the Arabians to the camp had slain all the eldest. So Ahaziah the son of Jehoram king of Judah reigned.","n":1,"sm":"Ieu Ona tofia lea e fai ma tupu e i latou e na nonofo i lerusalema o Aasaia lona atalii aupito itiiti e sui a4 o ia; aua na fasiotia o e matutua uma e ‘au na o mai ma tagata Arapi i le toagālauapi. O lea na fai ai ma tupu o Aasaia le atalii o Ioramo le tupu o Iuta.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ieu"},{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tofia"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"nonofo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lerusalema"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Aasaia"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"aupito"},{"en":"","sm":"itiiti"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sui"},{"en":"","sm":"a4"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"fasiotia"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"matutua"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"‘au"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"Arapi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"toagālauapi."},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Aasaia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioramo"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Iuta."}]},{"en":"Forty and two years old was Ahaziah when he began to reign, and he reigned one year in Jerusalem. His mother's name a